---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <!-- professional -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>you don't always need to know how, just why</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a developer who values the humanistic side of the user interfaces that
      surround us. Every proposed design and development decision should be
      guided by our 'why' — the theme, vision, and purpose. There's a
      responsibility for us to create experiences that are accessible,
      immersive, and deeply satisfying. My passion lies in finding the solutions
      that fulfill this purpose.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="paragraph">
    <span>--</span>
  </section>

  <!-- personal -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>evolving flow states</h1>
    <p>
      bodybuilding and strength training science - a pursuit that has honed my
      discipline, and inspires me to provide advice from a holistic perspective
    </p>
    <p>
      travelling - desire to immerse myself in new adventures, as the world is
      limitless with so much to offer and experience
    </p>
    <p>
      cooking principles - the craft and foundations of cooking while balancing
      cooking just for 'survival's sake'
    </p>
    <p>
      AI - utilizing tools to support learning and productivity, while being
      curious about its future role, implications, and ethics
    </p>
    <p>
      masterful communication - treating my voice like an instrument by
      improving on poise, eloquence, and influence to mend years of neglect
    </p>
    <p>
      video games - interests in storytelling and game theory, with the eventual
      goal of publishing my own
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-40);
  }
</style>
